All-

This is the summary regarding problems I had with the CDE under DU 3.2c,
after installing some patches on 13-Dec-95 (sorry it took so long to get this
to you, but I've just gotten final comfirmation of the problem).

As indicated in the original message (which is attached below, to refresh
