Hi all 

My original post asked how I could prevent the "automatic" cascading of my
X-windows.

The answer came from Alfred von Campe: alfred@hannah.enet.dec.com

What Alfred suggested was that I edit the file "/usr/lib/X11/app-defaults/Mwm"
checking for the following variable setting:

